{
 "Чему равен периметр ACFH?": "<figure class='st'><svg style='max-width:300px' viewBox='-14 -16 212 160' role='img' aria-label='Рисунок условия: квадрат ABGH, внутри горизонтали IM и KL, справа полоски BCFG и CDEF'><g fill='none' stroke='#cfdae6' stroke-width='1'><rect x='0' y='0' width='126' height='126'/><path d='M0 18H126M0 54H126'/><rect x='126' y='0' width='42' height='126'/><rect x='168' y='0' width='14' height='126'/></g><g fill='#e8eef6'><circle cx='0' cy='0' r='1.6'/><circle cx='126' cy='0' r='1.6'/><circle cx='168' cy='0' r='1.6'/><circle cx='182' cy='0' r='1.6'/><circle cx='0' cy='126' r='1.6'/><circle cx='126' cy='126' r='1.6'/><circle cx='168' cy='126' r='1.6'/><circle cx='182' cy='126' r='1.6'/><circle cx='0' cy='18' r='1.6'/><circle cx='0' cy='54' r='1.6'/><circle cx='126' cy='18' r='1.6'/><circle cx='126' cy='54' r='1.6'/></g><text x='-4' y='-4' fill='#e8eef6' font-size='8' text-anchor='end' font-weight='600'>H</text><text x='126' y='-5' fill='#e8eef6' font-size='8' text-anchor='middle' font-weight='600'>G</text><text x='167' y='-5' fill='#e8eef6' font-size='8' text-anchor='middle' font-weight='600'>F</text><text x='184' y='-5' fill='#e8eef6' font-size='8' text-anchor='start' font-weight='600'>E</text><text x='-5' y='21' fill='#e8eef6' font-size='8' text-anchor='end' font-weight='600'>I</text><text x='-5' y='57' fill='#e8eef6' font-size='8' text-anchor='end' font-weight='600'>K</text><text x='122' y='15' fill='#e8eef6' font-size='8' text-anchor='end' font-weight='600'>M</text><text x='122' y='51' fill='#e8eef6' font-size='8' text-anchor='end' font-weight='600'>L</text><text x='-4' y='136' fill='#e8eef6' font-size='8' text-anchor='end' font-weight='600'>A</text><text x='126' y='137' fill='#e8eef6' font-size='8' text-anchor='middle' font-weight='600'>B</text><text x='167' y='137' fill='#e8eef6' font-size='8' text-anchor='middle' font-weight='600'>C</text><text x='184' y='137' fill='#e8eef6' font-size='8' text-anchor='start' font-weight='600'>D</text></svg><figcaption>Рисунок из условия. Квадрат ABGH разрезан горизонталями IM и KL на три этажа; справа к нему во всю высоту приставлены полоска BCFG и ещё более узкая CDEF. Верх H, G, F, E и низ A, B, C, D — прямые линии.</figcaption></figure>",
 "Квадрат: нижняя сторона AB равна левой стороне AH": "<figure class='st'><svg style='max-width:260px' viewBox='-48 -12 190 158' role='img' aria-label='Сторона AH разрезана на k, 2k, 4k; сторона AB квадрата тоже 7k'><g fill='none' stroke='#4a5866' stroke-width='0.8'><rect x='0' y='0' width='126' height='126'/><path d='M0 18H126M0 54H126'/></g><g stroke='#f0a83c' stroke-width='1' fill='none'><path d='M-12 0H-6M-12 18H-6M-12 54H-6M-12 126H-6M-9 0V126'/></g><text x='-14' y='12.0' fill='#f0a83c' font-size='8' text-anchor='end' font-weight='600'>k</text><text x='-14' y='39.0' fill='#f0a83c' font-size='8' text-anchor='end' font-weight='600'>2k</text><text x='-14' y='93.0' fill='#f0a83c' font-size='8' text-anchor='end' font-weight='600'>4k</text><path d='M0 0V126' stroke='#f0a83c' stroke-width='2'/><path d='M0 126H126' stroke='#f0a83c' stroke-width='2'/><text x='-3' y='-4' fill='#93a1b1' font-size='7' text-anchor='end' font-weight='600'>H</text><text x='129' y='-4' fill='#93a1b1' font-size='7' text-anchor='start' font-weight='600'>G</text><text x='3' y='15' fill='#93a1b1' font-size='7' text-anchor='start' font-weight='600'>I</text><text x='3' y='51' fill='#93a1b1' font-size='7' text-anchor='start' font-weight='600'>K</text><text x='123' y='15' fill='#93a1b1' font-size='7' text-anchor='end' font-weight='600'>M</text><text x='123' y='51' fill='#93a1b1' font-size='7' text-anchor='end' font-weight='600'>L</text><text x='-3' y='135' fill='#93a1b1' font-size='7' text-anchor='end' font-weight='600'>A</text><text x='129' y='135' fill='#93a1b1' font-size='7' text-anchor='start' font-weight='600'>B</text><text x='63.0' y='139' fill='#f0a83c' font-size='8' text-anchor='middle' font-weight='600'>AB = 7k</text><text x='-38' y='63' transform='rotate(-90 -38 63)' fill='#f0a83c' font-size='8' text-anchor='middle' font-weight='600'>AH = 7k</text></svg><figcaption>Точки I и K режут левую сторону на куски k, 2k и 4k — всего 7k. Квадрат переносит эту длину на низ: AB тоже 7k, а с ним и горизонтали IM, KL, и высота полосок справа.</figcaption></figure>",
 "Контур KLMI: ширины KL и MI": "<figure class='st fx'><div class='fgrid2'><div class='cell'><svg viewBox='-14 -12 212 152' role='img' aria-label='Контур KLMI'><g fill='none' stroke='#4a5866' stroke-width='0.8'><rect x='0' y='0' width='126' height='126'/><path d='M0 18H126M0 54H126'/><rect x='126' y='0' width='42' height='126'/><rect x='168' y='0' width='14' height='126'/></g><g fill='#93a1b1' font-size='7' font-weight='600'><text x='-4' y='-3' text-anchor='end'>H</text><text x='126' y='-4' text-anchor='middle'>G</text><text x='168' y='-4' text-anchor='middle'>F</text><text x='184' y='-3' text-anchor='start'>E</text><text x='-4' y='21' text-anchor='end'>I</text><text x='-4' y='57' text-anchor='end'>K</text><text x='129' y='15' text-anchor='start'>M</text><text x='129' y='51' text-anchor='start'>L</text><text x='-4' y='133' text-anchor='end'>A</text><text x='126' y='134' text-anchor='middle'>B</text><text x='168' y='134' text-anchor='middle'>C</text><text x='184' y='133' text-anchor='start'>D</text></g><path class='dr' pathLength='100' style='--d:0.2s;--dur:2s' stroke='#f0a83c' stroke-width='2.2' fill='none' stroke-linejoin='round' d='M0 54L126 54L126 18L0 18Z'/><text x='63' y='48' fill='#f0a83c' font-size='8' text-anchor='middle' font-weight='600' class='fi' style='--d:0.9s'>a</text><text x='12' y='39' fill='#f0a83c' font-size='8' text-anchor='middle' font-weight='600' class='fi' style='--d:1.5s'>2k</text></svg><p class='ccap'><b>(2)</b> P(KLMI) = a + 2k + a + 2k = 324</p></div></div><figcaption>Единственный данный периметр. Ширина среднего этажа — вся сторона квадрата a, высота — кусок IK, то есть 2k. Других букв в этом контуре нет, поэтому вместе с (1) он сразу даёт k.</figcaption></figure>",
 "Каждый спрошенный периметр — тоже обход, и все четыре": "<figure class='st fx'><div class='fgrid2'><div class='cell'><svg viewBox='-14 -12 212 152' role='img' aria-label='Периметр IMGH'><g fill='none' stroke='#4a5866' stroke-width='0.8'><rect x='0' y='0' width='126' height='126'/><path d='M0 18H126M0 54H126'/><rect x='126' y='0' width='42' height='126'/><rect x='168' y='0' width='14' height='126'/></g><g fill='#93a1b1' font-size='7' font-weight='600'><text x='-4' y='-3' text-anchor='end'>H</text><text x='126' y='-4' text-anchor='middle'>G</text><text x='168' y='-4' text-anchor='middle'>F</text><text x='184' y='-3' text-anchor='start'>E</text><text x='-4' y='21' text-anchor='end'>I</text><text x='-4' y='57' text-anchor='end'>K</text><text x='129' y='15' text-anchor='start'>M</text><text x='129' y='51' text-anchor='start'>L</text><text x='-4' y='133' text-anchor='end'>A</text><text x='126' y='134' text-anchor='middle'>B</text><text x='168' y='134' text-anchor='middle'>C</text><text x='184' y='133' text-anchor='start'>D</text></g><path class='dr' pathLength='100' style='--d:0.2s;--dur:2s' stroke='#f0a83c' stroke-width='2.2' fill='none' stroke-linejoin='round' d='M0 18L126 18L126 0L0 0Z'/><text x='63' y='12' fill='#f0a83c' font-size='8' text-anchor='middle' font-weight='600' class='fi' style='--d:0.9s'>a</text><text x='8' y='12' fill='#f0a83c' font-size='8' text-anchor='middle' font-weight='600' class='fi' style='--d:1.5s'>k</text></svg><p class='ccap'><b>P(IMGH)</b> = 2 · (a + k)</p></div><div class='cell'><svg viewBox='-14 -12 212 152' role='img' aria-label='Периметр BCFG'><g fill='none' stroke='#4a5866' stroke-width='0.8'><rect x='0' y='0' width='126' height='126'/><path d='M0 18H126M0 54H126'/><rect x='126' y='0' width='42' height='126'/><rect x='168' y='0' width='14' height='126'/></g><g fill='#93a1b1' font-size='7' font-weight='600'><text x='-4' y='-3' text-anchor='end'>H</text><text x='126' y='-4' text-anchor='middle'>G</text><text x='168' y='-4' text-anchor='middle'>F</text><text x='184' y='-3' text-anchor='start'>E</text><text x='-4' y='21' text-anchor='end'>I</text><text x='-4' y='57' text-anchor='end'>K</text><text x='129' y='15' text-anchor='start'>M</text><text x='129' y='51' text-anchor='start'>L</text><text x='-4' y='133' text-anchor='end'>A</text><text x='126' y='134' text-anchor='middle'>B</text><text x='168' y='134' text-anchor='middle'>C</text><text x='184' y='133' text-anchor='start'>D</text></g><path class='dr' pathLength='100' style='--d:0.2s;--dur:2s' stroke='#f0a83c' stroke-width='2.2' fill='none' stroke-linejoin='round' d='M126 126L168 126L168 0L126 0Z'/><text x='147' y='120' fill='#f0a83c' font-size='8' text-anchor='middle' font-weight='600' class='fi' style='--d:0.9s'>b</text><text x='147' y='66' fill='#f0a83c' font-size='8' text-anchor='middle' font-weight='600' class='fi' style='--d:1.5s'>a</text></svg><p class='ccap'><b>P(BCFG)</b> = 2 · (b + a)</p></div><div class='cell'><svg viewBox='-14 -12 212 152' role='img' aria-label='Периметр BDEG'><g fill='none' stroke='#4a5866' stroke-width='0.8'><rect x='0' y='0' width='126' height='126'/><path d='M0 18H126M0 54H126'/><rect x='126' y='0' width='42' height='126'/><rect x='168' y='0' width='14' height='126'/></g><g fill='#93a1b1' font-size='7' font-weight='600'><text x='-4' y='-3' text-anchor='end'>H</text><text x='126' y='-4' text-anchor='middle'>G</text><text x='168' y='-4' text-anchor='middle'>F</text><text x='184' y='-3' text-anchor='start'>E</text><text x='-4' y='21' text-anchor='end'>I</text><text x='-4' y='57' text-anchor='end'>K</text><text x='129' y='15' text-anchor='start'>M</text><text x='129' y='51' text-anchor='start'>L</text><text x='-4' y='133' text-anchor='end'>A</text><text x='126' y='134' text-anchor='middle'>B</text><text x='168' y='134' text-anchor='middle'>C</text><text x='184' y='133' text-anchor='start'>D</text></g><path class='dr' pathLength='100' style='--d:0.2s;--dur:2s' stroke='#f0a83c' stroke-width='2.2' fill='none' stroke-linejoin='round' d='M126 126L182 126L182 0L126 0Z'/><text x='154' y='120' fill='#f0a83c' font-size='8' text-anchor='middle' font-weight='600' class='fi' style='--d:0.9s'>b + c</text><text x='154' y='66' fill='#f0a83c' font-size='8' text-anchor='middle' font-weight='600' class='fi' style='--d:1.5s'>a</text></svg><p class='ccap'><b>P(BDEG)</b> = 2 · ((b + c) + a)</p></div><div class='cell'><svg viewBox='-14 -12 212 152' role='img' aria-label='Периметр ACFH'><g fill='none' stroke='#4a5866' stroke-width='0.8'><rect x='0' y='0' width='126' height='126'/><path d='M0 18H126M0 54H126'/><rect x='126' y='0' width='42' height='126'/><rect x='168' y='0' width='14' height='126'/></g><g fill='#93a1b1' font-size='7' font-weight='600'><text x='-4' y='-3' text-anchor='end'>H</text><text x='126' y='-4' text-anchor='middle'>G</text><text x='168' y='-4' text-anchor='middle'>F</text><text x='184' y='-3' text-anchor='start'>E</text><text x='-4' y='21' text-anchor='end'>I</text><text x='-4' y='57' text-anchor='end'>K</text><text x='129' y='15' text-anchor='start'>M</text><text x='129' y='51' text-anchor='start'>L</text><text x='-4' y='133' text-anchor='end'>A</text><text x='126' y='134' text-anchor='middle'>B</text><text x='168' y='134' text-anchor='middle'>C</text><text x='184' y='133' text-anchor='start'>D</text></g><path class='dr' pathLength='100' style='--d:0.2s;--dur:2s' stroke='#f0a83c' stroke-width='2.2' fill='none' stroke-linejoin='round' d='M0 126L168 126L168 0L0 0Z'/><text x='84' y='120' fill='#f0a83c' font-size='8' text-anchor='middle' font-weight='600' class='fi' style='--d:0.9s'>a + b</text><text x='8' y='90' fill='#f0a83c' font-size='8' text-anchor='middle' font-weight='600' class='fi' style='--d:1.5s'>a</text></svg><p class='ccap'><b>P(ACFH)</b> = 2 · ((a + b) + a)</p></div></div><figcaption>Четыре спрошенных контура — четыре прямоугольника на одном чертеже. Высота у всех, кроме верхнего этажа, — сторона квадрата a; ширины складываются из кусков нижнего края.</figcaption></figure>",
